<title>USA: VeriFone to repurchase up to 200,000 shares.</title>
<headline>VeriFone to repurchase up to 200,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>VeriFone Inc said on Monday it will repurchase up to 200,000 of its common stock shares during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The company has authorized spending up to $9 million in cash on the open market to buy back the shares.  As of December 31 there were about 23.3 million VeriFone shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
